<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:20Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>特朗普據報將赴機場迎接習近平，待遇比肩教宗和赫魯曉夫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx980mjemv73o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:35:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T10:40:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx980mjemv73o/trad--8830b951cf8b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx980mjemv73o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統親赴機場迎接外國元首極為罕見。若不計教宗訪美的特例，這將是超過 60 年來美國總統首次以這種方式迎接他國元首。</summary></entry><entry><title>當白宮舉行宴會時，台灣會出現在「菜單」上嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62j7my13l3o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T00:19:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62j7my13l3o/trad--d4b229a665cf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62j7my13l3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日媒稱美中峰會前，白宮若批准新的對台軍售，習近平可能不去華府。對台灣的軍售從原則如何變成交易槓桿，台灣的晶片牌仍然有效嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>「運動員無法伸直雙腿睡覺」：日本亞運為何爆發住宿爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyzg2v80elo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T09:24:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyzg2v80elo/trad--93b5d7958a75.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyzg2v80elo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">亞運選手將入住木製貨櫃屋或一艘意大利郵輪。韓國代表團批評，貨櫃屋宿舍水管漏水，且床舖太小，運動員甚至無法伸直雙腿睡覺。</summary></entry><entry><title>澳洲收緊移民政策：管制留學生、背包客，打擊「簽證跳轉」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx24jdd1j59po/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T05:15:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx24jdd1j59po/trad--d642be59c997.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx24jdd1j59po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">澳洲政府希望在2028年前，將海外淨移民人數降至22.5萬人。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國科技巨頭呼籲放緩AI發展速度——中國怎麼看？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8y5z7y521eeo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T01:08:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8y5z7y521eeo/trad--02610cba4c15.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8y5z7y521eeo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著人工智能以驚人的速度發展，一些業內最傑出的領導者已經警告了它可能帶來的潛在風險。然而，世界兩大人工智能超級大國——中美之間的激烈競爭，可能會讓應對這項威脅的努力變得更加複雜。</summary></entry><entry><title>Hyrox失禁風波：澳洲選手道歉、主辦方承諾退款</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq3d7zld42m0o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T08:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq3d7zld42m0o/trad--f7d388368105.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq3d7zld42m0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Hyrox已更新賽例，明文規定若參賽者的「血液、嘔吐物、尿液或糞便」構成健康風險，可被要求退賽。</summary></entry><entry><title>領英高層分享6個人脈竅門，幫你更快找到工作</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T09:48:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad--e3616c6e04f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從咖啡閒聊到領英訊息，以下是如何透過人脈關係找到下一份工作的方法。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國三年來首次加息 對全球和中國意味著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm1j4kl4d21lo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T06:54:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm1j4kl4d21lo/trad--b79de3aac2cf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm1j4kl4d21lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">放到當下來看，中國和美國的經濟狀況可謂冰火兩重天——這並不是說誰的經濟更好、誰更差，而是兩國正面臨著截然相反的問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>美中峰會前，蕭美琴訪歐背後的「利基」外交</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T00:17:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad--6c87153cbaa0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">但在這樣的空間中，仍浮現出一條外交路徑：交往對象既不是一個主權國家，而是一個國際組織（即歐盟）；同時也不是其行政分支，而是其立法分支（歐洲議會）。這一雙重錯位，可以找到一個不容易受到中國壓力的外交場域。</summary></entry><entry><title>美籍緬甸裔學者涉間諜罪在華監禁　其妻籲特朗普晤習近平時重提此案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck980qm3dl3go/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T05:50:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck980qm3dl3go/trad--aaf6a8677a9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck980qm3dl3go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">西爾維婭·辛（Sylvia Zin）是多名被關押在中國人士的家屬之一，他們正尋求特朗普在下週接待中國領導人時提供協助。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港施政報告與「一五」同步公佈 聚焦北部都會區、國安與鼓勵生育</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm207gqz55r0o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T13:36:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm207gqz55r0o/trad--91e42be6a658.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm207gqz55r0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有評論形容，香港制訂五年規劃是「範式轉移」，意味著「從西方式資本主義市場經濟，改為接上中國特色社會主義市場經濟。」。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我接受了11年化療，卻發現從未患癌」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T00:18:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad--c278cc5b12f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">貝姬·瓊斯（Becky Jones）21歲被告知患有末期腦癌，接受了長達11年的化療，近期才發現根本不是癌症。和她有類似經歷的，還有同一間醫院的另外40多名病患。</summary></entry><entry><title>專家評中國修《國防動員法》：吸俄烏教訓實現「平戰快速轉換」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad--216c74954be4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新法還首次明定，18至60歲男性、18至55歲女性原則上須擔負國防勤務；金融、交通、電信、能源、醫療、糧食等關鍵領域，在動員期間均可採取特別措施。</summary></entry><entry><title>對台軍售成「特習會」談判籌碼？北京警告或取消峰會施壓特朗普</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cre30gqdn8xno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T11:18:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cre30gqdn8xno/trad--bf4bd261b932.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cre30gqdn8xno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美兩國元首本月稍後預定在華府舉行的「特習會」，是全球矚目的外交焦點，中方仍未公布行程。據報北京警告若華府會前批准新一輪百億美元對台軍售，或將取消峰會。</summary></entry><entry><title>人類真的可能被AI滅絕？我們可以如何阻止？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674k7gxpgplo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T09:55:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674k7gxpgplo/trad--c7c731884296.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674k7gxpgplo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人工智能（AI）快速發展之際，AI界對其潛在風險的公開討論也越來越多。部分科學家甚至估計，未來十年AI導致人類滅絕的可能性超過一成。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國有越來越多的男性開始「厭女」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwq63vj4q7q2o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T10:35:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwq63vj4q7q2o/trad--4909f2454858.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwq63vj4q7q2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這裡沒有像安德魯·泰特（Andrew Tate）那樣的網紅領導一場運動。相反地，這種挫折感散落在各個網路社群中，一些年輕男性在其中宣洩自己對戀愛以及建立家庭所需昂貴開銷的種種不滿。</summary></entry><entry><title>專訪鄧燕娥：與李卓人相伴四十年「互相撐著」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4jyk29dq7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T13:23:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4jyk29dq7o/trad--055d61cc8ab2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4jyk29dq7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">已解散的香港市民支援愛國民主運動聯合會（支聯會）被控「煽動他人顛覆國家政權」案正式宣判，前主席李卓人被定罪判刑7年。</summary></entry><entry><title>為甚麼我們會記錯911事件？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c74e03x93l7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T05:31:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c74e03x93l7o/trad--c40cf3f29fa7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c74e03x93l7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">記憶可能是錯的？911事件發生後，大部分人也許能清楚記得自己當時身在何處，以及是如何得知這消息。其他重大新聞事件也有類似的鮮明記憶。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國能在外太空部署哪些武器？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60re4x41yejo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T14:57:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60re4x41yejo/trad--cbe2a9f0842a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60re4x41yejo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國的宣佈顯示，地球軌道上的嶄新現代戰爭領域正在發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能踩「剎車」？特朗普：別忘了中美競爭</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T06:43:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad--abfd280f0f97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">上星期六，達里奧·阿摩迪（Dario Amodei）呼籲放緩發展步伐,以「降低出現嚴重問題的風險」，奧特曼和馬斯克均表示認同。這名Anthropic行政總裁同時強調，任何放緩都必須有所限度，以免讓中國反超領先。</summary></entry><entry><title>美軍航母全數撤離印太：台灣該擔心「空窗期」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:35:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad--6657e14d6610.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家稱，航母給美國盟友的是心理保證。印太區域沒有航母，「會加強一種整體感覺：美國正被中東局勢分心。」</summary></entry><entry><title>霍爾木茲海峽動盪，如何在巴拿馬運河引發中美角力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T13:39:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad--77ccfd7692d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國再次就巴拿馬運河問題交鋒。這條戰略水道約佔全球海運貿易量5%，而美國近40%的集裝箱運輸都經過這裏。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國稱數十國助中國避特朗普關稅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T05:11:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad--ca9553d15fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國一份新報告稱，中國透過關稅較低的國家轉運貨物，以規避較高關稅。</summary></entry><entry><title>星宇股份解約風波：107名應屆生「告洋狀」揭示中國勞工維權現狀</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T00:17:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad--8a55aafaa223.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月9日，就近期在中國引起轟動的「星宇股份解約107位應屆生」事件，上交所向星宇股份下發監管工作函，港交所延緩其上市審核，此前，公司董事長周曉萍已公開道歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>「贏了就是贏了」？Hyrox北京賽選手失禁奪冠為何引發爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c74e1wv1xkzo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T09:03:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c74e1wv1xkzo/trad--ce8470c50ba4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c74e1wv1xkzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一名澳洲籍選手在比賽期間懷疑失禁，排泄物沾染賽道和比賽設施，她繼續作賽並最終奪冠，事後一度發文稱「A win is a win（贏了就是贏了）」。事件引發「體育精神」的爭議，也有學者分析Hyrox商業化的速度，可能已超過其管理能力。</summary></entry><entry><title>威爾士、蘇格蘭和北愛爾蘭一起要「公投權」英國是否面臨分裂？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c85yd2dnw25vo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T07:37:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c85yd2dnw25vo/trad--8f9d367605db.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c85yd2dnw25vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">威爾斯黨、蘇格蘭民族黨和新芬黨的領導人表示，英國政府應該為憲政改革做好準備。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄烏戰場為何或會迎來新一批朝鮮軍人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T11:25:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad--bb5c4cb43663.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">朝鮮（北韓）士兵於2024年底被平壤派遣，與俄羅斯部隊並肩作戰，試圖擊退烏克蘭的一次攻勢。烏克蘭總統澤連斯基表示，俄羅斯沃羅涅日地區正進行準備，以接收新一批朝鮮部隊。</summary></entry><entry><title>董建華逝世：從船王富二代到香港首任特首，中共的「親密朋友」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T09:29:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad--7c9b72110192.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國全國政協前副主席，香港首任特首董建華逝世，享年89歲。他的前半生見證主權移交前香港的東方之珠年代，後半生更走入最高行政當局左右香港的前途。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國強勢下，歐洲電池工業謀求「重新充電」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad--fa0b5dd070c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲擁有一些前景可期的電池技術，但它能否追回被中國電池巨頭拉開的差距？</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平七年再訪印度：金磚峰會握手背後，中印關係破冰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T10:56:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad--f490ef71bcd9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">金磚峰會《新德里宣言》呼籲對伊朗戰爭「最大克制」卻不點名美國。而習近平七年首訪印度，中印關係解凍了嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>香港支聯會「煽動顛覆」案：被告們的伴侶與戰友</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T13:23:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad--ca085d2d883b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港支聯會「煽顛」案歷經五年，三名核心人物的判刑結果塵埃落定。BBC中文訪問李卓人的妻子鄧燕娥及鄒幸彤戰友劉家儀，講述他們如何面對香港的變遷和怎樣陪伴在牆內的人。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>AI「性轉」視頻風靡中國網絡：一場「 新文化運動」的覺醒與侷限</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn74d8mr640o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T00:14:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn74d8mr640o/trad--f99eecee7c89.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn74d8mr640o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">經典的「好太太」系列廣告以「好丈夫」的形象重出江湖：鏡頭前穿著清涼的不再是女性,而是男性。</summary></entry><entry><title>協助死亡：世界各地法律有何不同</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T08:19:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad--96fcfcf8ead4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球約有4億人可以獲得某種形式的協助死亡（安樂死）服務，這些國家的政策都是怎樣的？</summary></entry><entry><title>《匹茲堡醫魂》拿走了六個艾美獎，它的忠粉都是真醫生</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvgyn5gywz1o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T15:23:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvgyn5gywz1o/trad--e7292bfa9860.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvgyn5gywz1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">醫療專業人士表示，這部講述美國醫院急症室的 HBO Max 劇集，是迄今最真實的一部醫療劇。</summary></entry><entry><title>多熱才算太熱？牛津大學研究警告滾燙飲品可增加患癌風險</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjw595dw233o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T08:19:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjw595dw233o/trad--b2af29aa5177.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjw595dw233o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家表示，滾燙的液體在進入胃部途中，可能損害食道內壁的細胞。</summary></entry><entry><title>女性比男性更擅長耐力跑嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T02:47:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad--6fce54d2002f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近月來，女性在多項備受矚目的耐力賽事中擊敗男性對手。她們是否天生更適合這類挑戰？</summary></entry><entry><title>不同版本的世界地圖有哪些正確及錯誤之處？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-19T12:34:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T04:35:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad--ab1df95ad712.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">聯合國決計採用新的世界地圖來反映非洲的真實面積。但讓我們仔細看看不同版本的世界地圖有哪些正確和錯誤之處。</summary></entry></feed>
